{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方大字号、高亮度的白色长文字块，第一眼主要落在开头几行。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"一个还惦记着回去找回曾经亲近关系的人，正在犹豫是否回头。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不舍、犹豫、期待，带着不确定感。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他最终选择先把眼下日子过好；即使仍然害怕、心里没底，也不再因为害怕而收回向前走的打算。最后害怕仍在，但脚步已经向前。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块文字较长，内部包含回头的期待、现实选择、对未来的担忧以及向前行动等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在开头、中段和结尾，需要拼接才能理解他从想回头到决定向前走的变化。\",\n    \"右上角阶段目录字号明显较小，辅助信息不容易在快速扫视中直接获取。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "18226ef8-34d2-4245-a2ea-b2f63ef18285", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T015619840937Z", "elapsed_seconds": 23.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:56:42.875849+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "026ef48736822d602185fd740fd886258ff3dad5bfae668cf3ad55c506c7615d", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3